{"pageProps":{"meta":{"id":"obsidian:2026-11-07-official-35ace897d9c3-en","title":"Qwen3.8-27B-DSpine-b16 Can you chat alone, or do you need to use the target model?","date":"2026-11-07","updated":"2026-11-13","summary":"Tencent's draft weights need to be used in conjunction with the target model. First, clearly identify dependencies and inference entry points, then decide whether it's worth deploying.","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-Tech","name":"Tech","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["Tech"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-AI","name":"AI","color":"default"},{"id":"markdown-tag-1-Cutting-edge models","name":"Cutting-edge models","color":"default"}],"image":"/obsidian-assets/2026-11-07-official-35ace897d9c3/wordmark-wide-6c8e5be52b22.jpg","coverBlockId":null,"slug":"2026-11-07-official-35ace897d9c3-en","legacyPaths":[],"lang":"en","translationOf":"2026-11-07-official-35ace897d9c3","articleType":"model","discoveryName":"Qwen3.8-27B-DSpine-b16","discoveryCategory":"AI大模型","discoveryStage":"官方发布","discoveryUrl":"https://huggingface.co/tencent/Qwen3.8-27B-DSpine-b16","source":"markdown","fixedProductFooter":true},"markdownHtml":"<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Info: Machine translation</strong>\nThis post was machine-translated from the Chinese original. Wording may be rough in places — the <a href=\"https://hyphentech.top/2026-11-07-official-35ace897d9c3/\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://hyphentech.top/2026-11-07-official-35ace897d9c3/\">Chinese version</a> is authoritative.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>When you see Qwen3.8-27B-DSpine-b16 under Tencent accounts, don’t treat it as a small model that can chat independently after downloading. The official model card lists it as the draft weight for Qwen3.8-27B, and the instructions also require specifying both the target model and the draft model. It’s more suitable for those who are already preparing to use the target model and want to further research the supporting reasoning process.</p>\n<h2>The page shows two billion parameters, so why do you need another model?</h2>\n<p>The model size bar on the page is marked as 2B, which is 2 billion parameters. But this number describes the current model size of the warehouse and cannot be used as the scale of the entire operating plan. The official explanation clearly states that the word segmentation, word embedding, and language model output header are provided by the target model.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/2026-11-07-official-35ace897d9c3/source-evidence-1-da9267ba.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/9fae267967c78102b25bc849-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/9fae267967c78102b25bc849-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/2026-11-07-official-35ace897d9c3/source-evidence-1-da9267ba.png\" alt=\"Target Model Dependency\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"900\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>You can understand these dependencies by using parcel pickup: the word segmentation is responsible for breaking down input into system-ready numbers, such as organizing parcel information into a queryable pickup record; Word embedding converts the number into a representation used by the model, such as finding the corresponding location based on the record; The output head then maps the internal calculation results back to candidate terms, such as remapping the location to a package that can be delivered to the recipient. This is just an analogy of functional relationships. The fact that affects usage choices here is: these components need to be provided by the target model, and the current warehouse does not provide a complete set.</p>\n<p>Therefore, those looking for an independent chat model should not add it to their download list just by looking at the 2 billion parameters. For those already studying Qwen 3.8-27B inference, this draft weight is worth further reviewing; What needs to be verified is whether the entire set of integrations can work, not just how large the draft file is.</p>\n<h2>The usage entry point is a supporting reasoning process, not a ready-made chat service</h2>\n<p>Official usage points to Qwen3.8-27B in DSpine Inference Explanation: Set the target model path to Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B, and the draft model path to the current repository or its local directory. In other words, the configuration must clearly distinguish between two roles; simply filling the draft repository into the target model’s location does not mean deployment is complete.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/2026-11-07-official-35ace897d9c3/source-evidence-2-baa65d3a.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/9fae267967c78102b25bc849-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/9fae267967c78102b25bc849-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/2026-11-07-official-35ace897d9c3/source-evidence-2-baa65d3a.png\" alt=\"Official Usage\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"900\"></picture></a></p>\n<p>Don’t confuse the b16 in the name with precision. The model card lists block size as 16 and precision as BF16; These are different configuration options. The official page does not provide acceleration scores for this draft weight, memory requirements, or specific device adaptation results, so it cannot be used to determine whether a regular computer will work, nor can it guarantee that installing it will be faster.</p>\n<p>If you want to experience it directly through the online portal without deploying, the page also does not provide a ready-made answer: during data collection, the managed inference area clearly shows that no inference service provider has deployed this model. This describes the service status listed on the page and does not mean other channels necessarily do not have services.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/2026-11-07-official-35ace897d9c3/source-evidence-3-355acd5a.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/f95f70f5ded69ffe6bf6aff7-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/f95f70f5ded69ffe6bf6aff7-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/2026-11-07-official-35ace897d9c3/source-evidence-3-355acd5a.png\" alt=\"Managed Service Status\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"900\"></picture></a></p>\n<h2>What matters now is verifying the entire chain rather than rushing to download</h2>\n<p>What can be confirmed now is that a model card has appeared under the Tencent account, explaining the purpose, configuration, and supporting entry point for draft weights. The page also states that training will start on October 27, 2026, but that is the training date, not the release date. The information does not provide an official release date, nor does it provide a file list or actual download verification, so you cannot directly write the appearance of the model card as having validated weight and downloadable status.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>If you just want to chat directly: First, choose a target model with a complete usage entry point, and don’t treat the draft weight as an independent substitute.</li>\n<li>Preparing to study companion inference: starting from the usage instructions of the model card into DSpine, further verifying the loading methods, runtime support, and hardware requirements of the target model and draft model.</li>\n<li>Preparing for download or project use: separately confirm whether the weighting files are actually available, as well as the licenses for the target model, draft weights, and runtime code; Existing information does not provide a complete licensing conclusion.</li>\n<li>Prepare to decide if it’s worth adopting: After successfully loading, use your actual task to record output, time, and resource usage, then decide whether to keep this setup; Currently, there are no official performance scores available for reference.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Next, you can check <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/tencent/Qwen3.8-27B-DSpine-b16#usage\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://huggingface.co/tencent/Qwen3.8-27B-DSpine-b16#usage\">official model card and usage instructions</a>. After confirming the target model, draft weights, runtime environment, and permissions item by item, proceed to deployment. For those who only need an immediately accessible chat entry, this repository is currently not the first choice; For those studying the target model’s inference process, it is a supporting resource that needs further verification.</p>\n<h2>Official information</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/tencent/Qwen3.8-27B-DSpine-b16\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"Opens in a new tab · https://huggingface.co/tencent/Qwen3.8-27B-DSpine-b16\">Tencent Hunyuan Official Release Statement</a></li>\n</ul>\n","relatedPosts":[{"id":"obsidian:2026-11-11-official-4412c828c967","rawId":"obsidian:2026-11-11-official-4412c828c967","slug":"2026-11-11-official-4412c828c967-en","legacyPaths":[],"title":"After DeepSeek Harness supports multi-agent collaboration, should existing projects be upgraded?","date":"2026-11-11","updated":"2026-11-11","summary":"The new pre-release version adds collaboration and review features, but work tree cleaning, search configuration, and tool authorization are more worth checking before the upgrade.",